{"id":"8b837970593eed21","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-ml-deficiency.md","title":"前缀复杂度随机性亏损","display":"df-ml-deficiency — 前缀复杂度随机性亏损","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-ml-deficiency","aliases":["43-df-ml-deficiency"],"display":"df-ml-deficiency — 前缀复杂度随机性亏损","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.4、Theorem 9.3.9，印刷170、180–181，PDF190、200–201","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-ml-deficiency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-ml-deficiency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ml-deficiency — 前缀复杂度随机性亏损"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.4、Theorem 9.3.9，印刷170、180–181，PDF190、200–201"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 中固定最优前缀复杂度；上确界在扩展实数中取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{def}_{K}(X)=\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigl(n-K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{def}_{K}(X)=\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigl(n-K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>更换最优机器只使亏损改变有界常数。亏损有限恰好等价于ML随机性。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.2 Definition 9.2.4、Theorem 9.3.9，印刷170、180–181，PDF190、200–201。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$K$ 是 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 中固定最优前缀复杂度；上确界在扩展实数中取。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{def}_{K}(X)=\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigl(n-K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1088,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-ml-deficiency]] — 前缀复杂度随机性亏损"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848"]}